WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.305
Half, then full.

00:01.998 --> 00:04.238
A week after new we see half of the lit side.

00:04.720 --> 00:06.229
That is called the first quarter.

00:06.647 --> 00:12.452
A week later the Moon is on the far side of the Earth from the Sun, and the whole face we see is in daylight.

00:13.151 --> 00:16.552
That is full Moon, and it rises as the Sun sets.
